        },
        {
          "text": " Kabona taafumbirwenga mukazi eyanoba, oba ye baabinga mu irya. Aidha kufumbirwanga mughala Muisiraeli omwegha, oba namwandu ow'eyali kabona eyafa.",
          "type": "text",
