              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 18:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Bakabona tibaabenga na kintu kyonakyona kya nsikirano. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze obusika bwaibwe. Era mutabaghanga mugabo gwonagwona mu Isiraeli. Nze ninze omugabo gwaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.18.8+EXO.18.9+EXO.18.10+EXO.18.11+EXO.18.12+EXO.18.13+EXO.18.14+EXO.18.15+EXO.18.16+EXO.18.17+EXO.18.18+EXO.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 18:8-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baidha kulyanga ebyo abantu bye banaaleetanga, ng'ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke, ebigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'ebigheebwayo ng'omutango. Na buli kintu kyonakyona ekinaagheebwangayo mu Isiraeli okuba ekyange kinaabanga kyaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bintu bye musooka okukungula byonabyona, ni ku bintu bye mughaayo ye ndi, mwidha kutoolangaku ebisinga bulungi bibenga bya bakabona. Era mwidha kubaleeteranga n'engaano ye munaasookanga okukanda, olwo enkabi dhibenga mu maka gaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.44.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 44:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
